{
  "message": "Here's the good news: the design itself checks out. No checks failed. All eight blockers are the same kind of issue: the tool can't yet generate Azure code for Event Hubs, Functions redaction, Data Explorer, Container Apps, Content Safety, Azure OpenAI or App Service, and the existing synthetic services still need a plan for how we'll reference them. Changing the diagram can't fix that. It's engineering work on the product, and this revision 2 report is the test case to reproduce it with. Squeezing the design into the one Azure contract we have, private object storage, would cut out the workload you asked for, so I haven't changed the board.\n\nTo focus that work and pick where the resources will run, which country must this telemetry stay in?",
